# CLI Reference

OpenThesis is invoked as `openthesis <command> [flags]`.

!!! note "Auto-generated"
    This page is generated from the CLI source. Run `make docs` to regenerate it.
    Do not edit `site/docs/reference/cli.md` directly — changes will be overwritten.

## Global flags

These flags apply to thin-client operations that connect to a running OpenThesis API server.

| Flag | Env var | Description |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `--server <addr>` | `OPENTHESIS_SERVER` | Address of the OpenThesis API server |
| `--api-key <key>` | `OPENTHESIS_API_KEY` | Authentication key for the API server |

---

## Environment variables

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `OPENTHESIS_STATE_DIR` | Default state directory (overrides `--state-dir` default) |
| `OPENTHESIS_CONFIG` | Default config file path |
| `OPENTHESIS_DEV_ADDR` | Default live dashboard address (same as `--dev-addr`) |
| `OPENTHESIS_OUTPUT_DIR` | SDK output directory — set automatically inside VMs |
| `OPENTHESIS_SEED` | SDK PRNG seed — set automatically inside VMs |

